COMPILATION OF: E49B3

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E49B3

   1 a 0000 E49B3:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-49/P2] member-vs-member with UNEQUAL extents, the LONGER
   4 a 0006      one on the LEFT: char(3) vs char(2).  [C334]'s positional law
   5 a 0006      (B = LEFT operand's attribute, A = RIGHT's) was measured only
   6 a 0006      on member-vs-literal pairs; here both attributes are DECLARED
   7 a 0006      extents, so the pair predicts `06 03 / 3E 02'.  Falsifiers:
   8 a 0006      `06 02 / 3E 03' (side-inverted), `06 02 / 3E 02' (min), `06 03
   9 a 0006      / 3E 03' (max), refusal. */
  10 c 0006   dcl
  11 c 0006     1 rec,
  12 c 0006       2 na char(3),
  13 c 0006       2 nb char(3),
  14 c 0006       2 s2 char(2);
  15 c 0006   dcl k fixed bin(15);
  16 c 0006   if rec.na = rec.s2 then k = 1;
  17 c 001E   put list('K=', k);
  18 c 0040   stop;
  19 a 0043 end E49B3;

CODE SIZE = 0043
DATA AREA = 000C
FREE SYMS = 3888
END  COMPILATION
